1
00:00:00,559 --> 00:00:03,229
(Penny:)Oh, hey, Sheldon.
What you got there? New comic book?

2
00:00:03,395 --> 00:00:05,355
(Sheldon:)Old comic book.

3
00:00:05,522 --> 00:00:08,942
(Sheldon:)I just retrieved it
from my safe-deposit box.

4
00:00:09,276 --> 00:00:11,406
(Penny:)What do you have
a safe-deposit box for?

5
00:00:12,279 --> 00:00:14,739
(Sheldon:)Old comic books.

6
00:00:15,115 --> 00:00:19,575
(Sheldon:)I lost this to Wolowitz
in an ill-considered cricket wager.

7
00:00:19,745 --> 00:00:22,245
(Penny:)What, do they have Wii cricket now?

8
00:00:23,832 --> 00:00:25,792
(Penny:)That can't be very popular.

9
00:00:26,251 --> 00:00:28,001
(Sheldon:)Penny, I'd rather not talk about it.

10
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:32,170
(Penny:)Well, if it makes you feel any better,
I'm not feeling so hot either.

11
00:00:32,633 --> 00:00:34,763
(Sheldon:)Why would that make me feel better?

12
00:00:35,761 --> 00:00:37,301
(Penny:)I don't know, empathy?

13
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:45,190
(Penny:)I'm just saying that you're feeling upset
about something with Howard...

14
00:00:45,354 --> 00:00:47,274
(Penny:)...and I'm upset about something
with Leonard.

15
00:00:47,439 --> 00:00:49,439
(Sheldon:)Yes, the disappointing sex.

16
00:00:50,651 --> 00:00:51,981
(Sheldon:)That's an inexact parallel.

17
00:00:52,152 --> 00:00:54,782
(Sheldon:)You and Leonard can always return
to being friends.

18
00:00:54,947 --> 00:00:58,287
(Sheldon:)I can never return to a state
in which Wolowitz has not bested me...

19
00:00:58,450 --> 00:01:01,120
(Sheldon:)...like Mrs. Riley's chicken.

